This project includes or depends on third-party work:

- TinyStories-8M (roneneldan/TinyStories-8M, Hugging Face; Eldan & Li, 2023). A copy of its
  weights with the vocabulary pruned from 50k to 15k tokens is included as
  web/public/data/model.bin, so the site can run the model in the browser. The model card states
  no license; check it before any commercial use.
- Qwen3.5-0.8B (Qwen team, Hugging Face). Recorded statistics and steering outputs derived from
  the model are published. The weights themselves are not redistributed.
- Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct_bad-medical-advice (ModelOrganismsForEM, Hugging Face). Recorded
  statistics and steering outputs on neutral prompts are published. The merged weights are not
  redistributed.
- The visual approach of the 3D map is inspired by lyramakesmusic/neuron-explorer
  (https://github.com/lyramakesmusic/neuron-explorer). No code is copied from it.
- three.js (MIT), React (MIT), and the other npm packages listed in web/package.json, under
  their own licences.

The refusal-ablated (Heretic) weights, and their answers to harmful prompts, are never published.
They are written only to the git-ignored research-private/ directory. The site publishes only
aggregate refusal rates and examples on harmless prompts (ADR-002).
